menu "Settings Application"

    config SETTINGS_UI_ROUND_DISPLAY
        bool "Lay out the Settings UI for a round display"
        default y
        help
            Enable on boards with a circular panel, such as the XC 3.4C
            (800x800) and 4C (720x720). Headers, buttons and lists are then
            kept inside the visible circle. Disable on rectangular or square
            panels to get the plain rectangular layout.

endmenu
